# What `git archive` leaves out of a release. The published archive is what
# every consumer downloads and what the registry presubmit extracts, so it
# carries the ruleset, its tests and its documentation — not the tooling used
# to develop it or the record of how it was planned.
.agents/ export-ignore
.claude/ export-ignore
.codex/ export-ignore
.mcp.json export-ignore
CLAUDE.md export-ignore
openspec/ export-ignore
openwiki/ export-ignore
.gitattributes export-ignore
